  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Conversion of dwelling into two flats (2 X 2 bed); front porch; separate amenity space; bin and cycle stores",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of the substandard internal floor area of the upper floor flat including an undersized combined living/kitchen space, and the poor daylight access to the ground floor flat’s internalised living room due to its north-facing orientation and lack of direct outlook, would result in a poor quality of internal living environment for future occupiers. The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policies DM1, and DM26 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), and the London Plan Guidance - Housing Design Standards (2023).&nbsp;"
  ],
